<title>FINLAND: RAUTE 1996 PROFIT SURGES TO FIM 14.9 MLN.</title>
<headline>RAUTE 1996 PROFIT SURGES TO FIM 14.9 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to Dec 31,</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit after fin items			  14.9 vs 3.3</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   3.38 vs 0.85</p>
<p> Net sales					  748.4 vs 782.9</p>
<p> Operating profit				  10.2 vs 8.6</p>
<p> Operating profit before depreciation	36.0 vs 29.7</p>
<p> Depreciation					25.9 vs 21.1</p>
<p> Net financial items			 gain 4.7 vs 5.3 charge</p>
<p> Extraordinary income			    10.4 vs nil</p>
<p> Extraordinary expenses			  19.8 vs 2.2</p>
<p> Profit before appropriations, tax	    5.5 vs 1.1</p>
<p> Taxes						  4.1 vs 4.5</p>
<p> Net profit					   2.5 vs 7.6 loss</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)	    38.2 vs 35.4</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish engineering group is Raute Oy.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +35 89 6805 0245</p>
</text>
